      <li><strong>Crossover tube diagnostic discipline.</strong> Different from ignition module failure — visual check first, often resolves no-parts. Many shops miss this and quote module replacement unnecessarily.</li>
      <li><strong>BHGS Registration #A49573 and EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410).</strong> CSLB C-20 HVAC. BBB Accredited Business. See our <a href="/credentials/licensed/">licensing page</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>$89 outdoor diagnostic, no after-hours surcharge.</strong> Same-day across LA, OC, Ventura. Phones answered 24/7.</li>
    </ul>
